=== BOOT 1 (write) ===
Bedrock: entering serial shell. Try 'help'.

bedrock> rm persist.txt
removed persist.txt
bedrock> write persist.txt hello-from-boot-one
wrote 19 bytes to persist.txt
bedrock> ls
  persist.txt                  inode 1   19 bytes
bedrock> cat persist.txt
hello-from-boot-one
bedrock> 
=== BOOT 2 (separate QEMU process: read back + rename) ===
Bedrock: entering serial shell. Try 'help'.

bedrock> ls
  persist.txt                  inode 1   19 bytes
bedrock> cat persist.txt
hello-from-boot-one
bedrock> mv persist.txt renamed.txt
persist.txt -> renamed.txt
bedrock> ls
  renamed.txt                  inode 1   19 bytes
bedrock> 
=== BOOT 3 (separate QEMU process: rename survived, then delete) ===
Bedrock: entering serial shell. Try 'help'.

bedrock> ls
  renamed.txt                  inode 1   19 bytes
bedrock> cat renamed.txt
hello-from-boot-one
bedrock> rm renamed.txt
removed renamed.txt
bedrock> ls
(empty)
bedrock> 